{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30349","headline":"宿楚国寺有怀 · 赵嘏","name":"宿楚国寺有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风动衰荷寂寞香，断烟残月共苍苍。\n寒生晚寺波摇壁，红堕疎林叶满牀。\n起雁似惊南浦棹，阴云欲护北楼霜。\n江边松菊荒应尽，八月长安夜正长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}